Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.37,0:00:05.47,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,50)}Let's travel all through the worldwide seas,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.71,0:00:07.88,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,raising our battle cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.00,0:00:12.26,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,If you've made up your mind, let the signal for departure
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.36,0:00:14.68,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,ring out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.87,0:00:25.35,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,We were able to escape from the set course
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.48,0:00:29.00,Credits,,0,0,0,,{\pos(496,512)}Translation & initial timing\N{\fs40}Vegapunk Fansubs
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.48,0:00:28.90,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,along the boundary between sky and sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.02,0:00:34.13,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,Now we're rowing our way
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.40,0:00:34.55,Credits,,0,0,0,,{\pos(528,540)}Timing\N{\fs40}Galaxy 9000
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.55,0:00:40.66,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,to a hidden adventure at the dark bottom of the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.61,0:00:40.74,Credits,,0,0,0,,{\pos(294,372)}Quality checking\N{\fs40}Sewil
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.74,0:00:47.50,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,Doesn't it sound fun just thinking about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.95,0:00:44.12,Credits,,0,0,0,,{\pos(766,480)}Editing\N{\fs40}Sewil
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.29,0:00:47.50,Credits,,0,0,0,,{\pos(770,540)}Soundtracking\N{\fs40}Halee
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.79,0:00:51.92,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,Let's travel all through the worldwide seas,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.01,0:00:54.26,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,raising our battle cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.38,0:00:58.60,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,If you've made up your mind, let the signal for departure
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.76,0:01:01.01,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,ring out.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.40,0:01:11.61,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,50)}That feeling we had when we set sail
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.67,0:01:15.07,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,is something I'll never forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.26,0:01:16.86,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,Because of that
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.03,0:01:20.51,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,nothing will be able to scare me...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.81,0:01:26.79,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,Now, as the trip approaches, our racing heartbeats
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.98,0:01:33.71,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,engrave a rhythm of adventure in our shy hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.96,0:01:38.13,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,50)}Get all the treasures
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.22,0:01:40.39,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,while laughing out loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.51,0:01:44.81,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,Give them all out at a big party
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.89,0:01:47.48,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}making a splash...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.57,0:02:04.66,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,Fill your empty heart with dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.79,0:02:07.00,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,Spread your wings.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.23,0:02:11.33,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,If you color your heart with the blowing wind
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.42,0:02:13.67,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,you will move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.71,0:02:17.84,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,Get all the treasures
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.01,0:02:20.18,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,while laughing out loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.30,0:02:24.54,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,Give them all out at a big party
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.72,0:02:27.31,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,making a splash...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.87,0:02:38.62,Title,,0,0,200,,{\an8\fad(1800,2000)}培羅娜的奇幻花園與\N將軍殭屍的突擊！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.13,0:02:43.60,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,不管他們逃到哪裡，追蹤他們然後拖到這裡來！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.60,0:02:46.14,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,沒有人是殭屍將軍們的對手！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.77,0:02:51.65,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,喂，別浪費時間了，約翰船長。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.65,0:02:54.66,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,你真是辜負了你生前的惡名。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.66,0:02:56.51,Main,John,0,0,0,,好好好。我去了。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.86,0:03:00.57,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,天哪…他一點都沒變…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.57,0:03:02.03,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,阿布大人…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.03,0:03:03.56,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,嫁給我！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.72,0:03:05.56,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,蘿拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.56,0:03:08.17,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,你…！給我馬上去戰鬥！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.17,0:03:09.62,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,我才是這裡的指揮官！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.62,0:03:10.84,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,那，嫁給我。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.84,0:03:11.62,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,我為什麼要？！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.23,0:03:19.98,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,蘿拉…你在幹什麼…？！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.98,0:03:23.16,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,你不打算聽墓場阿布大人的命令嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.16,0:03:24.69,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,那，嫁給我！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.69,0:03:25.78,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,別開玩笑了！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.78,0:03:27.36,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,我是人類！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.36,0:03:29.90,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,我要娶的是人類新娘！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.48,0:03:32.69,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,喂，蘿拉…你想想。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.69,0:03:35.33,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,你是一隻母野豬殭屍。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.33,0:03:37.37,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,你已經死了而且在腐爛！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.13,0:03:42.78,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,住手！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.56,0:03:46.41,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,喂，好恐怖的手段！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.41,0:03:48.82,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,那不是結婚證書嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.82,0:03:52.04,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,你竟然想強迫我結婚！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.04,0:03:56.04,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,我就是無法抗拒你那野性的口鼻。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.04,0:03:59.14,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,阿布薩羅姆，把你的手指給我。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.14,0:03:59.88,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,我愛你！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.08,0:04:02.35,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,別鬧了！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.35,0:04:05.76,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,我才不要整天被一隻死動物纏著！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.76,0:04:07.10,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}新娘術…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.10,0:04:08.64,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}宣誓之吻！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.54,0:04:18.41,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,等等，蘿拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.41,0:04:19.57,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,聽仔細了。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.18,0:04:21.58,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,我已經…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.58,0:04:24.96,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,我已經選好了要成為我新娘的女人！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.96,0:04:29.31,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,她性格確實很強硬，但歸根究底她是個柔弱的血肉之軀的女人！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.30,0:04:32.13,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,反正你又會失敗的。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.13,0:04:33.16,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,笨蛋，你看！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.80,0:04:38.71,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,她是登上這座島的海賊之一，完美適合成為這個帥男人的新娘。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.71,0:04:40.41,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,我不會讓你得逞的！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.41,0:04:42.42,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,那個女人…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.42,0:04:43.74,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,我要除掉她！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.01,0:04:46.12,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,等等！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.12,0:04:48.80,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,蘿拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.80,0:04:52.21,Main,Perona,0,0,0,,喂，庫瑪西！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.21,0:04:54.60,Main,Perona,0,0,0,,庫瑪西！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.04,0:04:58.00,Main,Perona,0,0,0,,冒險兄弟會把棺材送來。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.00,0:05:01.59,Main,Perona,0,0,0,,收到後，送到主人的舞廳去！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.59,0:05:02.32,Main,Perona,0,0,0,,聽清楚了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.08,0:05:06.40,Main,Perona,0,0,0,,到底聽清楚了沒有？！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.40,0:05:07.09,Main,Kumashi,0,0,0,,是的…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.09,0:05:10.24,Main,Perona,0,0,0,,不要回答，不可愛！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.24,0:05:14.12,Main,Perona,0,0,0,,從現在起，我要帶領收集寶物的小組去那艘船。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.67,0:05:17.29,Main,Perona,0,0,0,,如果有什麼事，來告訴我，知道嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.79,0:05:22.96,Main,Perona,0,0,0,,對嘛，你不說話的時候好可愛！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.55,0:05:25.33,Main,Kumashi,0,0,0,,一…一路順風…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.33,0:05:28.04,Main,Perona,0,0,0,,你！你剛才說話了！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.16,0:05:36.62,Main,Squirrel,0,0,0,,送過去！送過去！送到主人的巢穴去！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.46,0:05:43.56,Main,Squirrel,0,0,0,,糟糕！掉了！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.56,0:05:44.94,Main,Squirrel,0,0,0,,糟糕！摔壞了！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.94,0:05:47.25,Main,Squirrel,0,0,0,,給主人的貨物！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.98,0:05:51.24,Main,Squirrel,0,0,0,,棺材打開了！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.24,0:05:52.54,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,我在哪裡？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.54,0:05:53.25,Main,Squirrel,0,0,0,,他醒了！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.25,0:05:53.87,Main,Squirrel,0,0,0,,可惡！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.87,0:05:55.92,Main,Squirrel,0,0,0,,快打他！打死他！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.92,0:05:57.09,Main,Squirrel,0,0,0,,殺生不好！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.09,0:05:58.08,Main,Squirrel,0,0,0,,那，半殺！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.08,0:05:59.21,Main,Squirrel,0,0,0,,半殺！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.81,0:06:04.48,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,騙人布！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.48,0:06:05.48,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,娜美！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.48,0:06:06.80,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,喂，撐住！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.07,0:06:08.51,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,醒醒！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.87,0:06:14.85,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,那個武士…果然…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.85,0:06:17.06,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,他用刀背打我們的嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.53,0:06:20.27,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,這裡好像下過雨了。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.27,0:06:21.98,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,地面有點濕。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.98,0:06:23.24,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,我們在哪裡？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.24,0:06:24.60,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,不知道，但是…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.60,0:06:28.17,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,剛才那些松鼠把我們裝在棺材裡搬運。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.35,0:06:30.80,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,這不是鐵棺材嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.07,0:06:33.49,Main,Squirrel,0,0,0,,糟了，那三個醒了！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.49,0:06:35.45,Main,Squirrel,0,0,0,,不好了。叫夥伴過來！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.69,0:06:38.72,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,看起來…我們現在在宅邸的後面。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.72,0:06:41.96,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,霍古巴克的研究室在最上層。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.96,0:06:44.96,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,他們好像已經搬了我們很遠了。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.96,0:06:45.88,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,喂，看你們後面！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.91,0:06:50.97,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,對面有一棟堅固的建築！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.97,0:06:52.80,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,那是什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.36,0:06:57.50,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,宅邸後面一直有這麼大的建築？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.70,0:07:01.26,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,我搞清楚我們在哪裡了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.00,0:07:02.65,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.31,0:07:05.06,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,你什麼意思？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.67,0:07:10.24,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,我們在連接宅邸和那棟大建築的通道上。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.24,0:07:11.85,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,通道？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.85,0:07:15.35,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,這麼寬闊，簡直像森林一樣。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.35,0:07:22.46,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,就算做成了森林，他們在我們昏迷時是搬著棺材走這條路的。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.07,0:07:27.64,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,也就是說，他們肯定是要把我們搬到那棟建築裡。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.64,0:07:31.65,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,那裡大概就是製造殭屍的地方。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.12,0:07:34.70,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,還好我們醒了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.70,0:07:35.34,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,快逃！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.34,0:07:37.36,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,沒錯！快逃，馬上！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.36,0:07:38.27,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,等一下！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.71,0:07:45.73,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,我們因為害怕到處亂跑亂叫，結果什麼寶物都沒拿到…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.73,0:07:46.43,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,這樣可以嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.43,0:07:48.26,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,你在想什麼，白痴？！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.26,0:07:51.65,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,我的「有鬼」感應器正在瘋狂反應！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.65,0:07:53.83,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,快跑就對了，娜美！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.83,0:07:55.60,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,對對對！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.60,0:07:57.42,Main,,0,0,0,,快跑！快跑！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.79,0:07:58.43,Thoughts,Nami,0,0,0,,我清楚記得那個殭屍當時說的話。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.52,0:08:01.75,Flashbacks,Zombie,0,0,0,,真可惜！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.75,0:08:03.93,Flashbacks,Zombie,0,0,0,,寶庫不在這裡！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.24,0:08:07.71,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,別想有的沒的了，快跑！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.71,0:08:09.63,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,快跑，娜美！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.63,0:08:10.63,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,太蠢了！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.63,0:08:13.51,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,我終於搞懂了！當時只是太害怕了！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.51,0:08:15.16,Main,Both,0,0,0,,奇怪的眼神！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.87,0:08:17.63,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,那，往哪邊跑？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.63,0:08:18.29,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,前面？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.29,0:08:19.10,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,後面？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.91,0:08:21.53,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,真是難以抉擇。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.53,0:08:25.62,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,回宅邸的話，很可能會再碰到那個武士。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.62,0:08:29.84,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,但往前走的話，可能會遇到更恐怖的傢伙。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.55,0:08:36.69,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,這些小動物是什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.69,0:08:37.24,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,企鵝？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.68,0:08:38.93,Main,Penguin 1,0,0,0,,編號！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.93,0:08:39.54,Main,Penguin 1,0,0,0,,一！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.89,0:08:40.47,Main,Penguin 2,0,0,0,,二！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.81,0:08:41.66,Main,Sanji-pen,0,0,0,,三！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.21,0:08:44.67,Thoughts,NUC,0,0,0,,不…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.92,0:08:47.09,Main,Penguin 1,0,0,0,,你好，我們是…！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.09,0:08:48.72,Main,Penguin 2,0,0,0,,企鵝殭屍雙人——
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.72,0:08:50.16,Main,Penguin 2,0,0,0,,啊，我搞錯了。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.16,0:08:51.56,Main,Sanji-pen,0,0,0,,三人組！我們是三人組！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.56,0:08:52.63,Main,Sanji-pen,0,0,0,,我是新來的！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.63,0:08:55.17,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,誰在乎你們的成員資訊啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.17,0:08:57.97,Main,Penguin 1,0,0,0,,而且在你們後面的是…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.97,0:08:58.62,Main,All,0,0,0,,不會吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.62,0:09:01.02,Main,Penguin 1,0,0,0,,我們的同伴，野生殭屍！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.02,0:09:04.31,Main,Zombies,0,0,0,,歡迎來到培羅娜大人的奇幻花園！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.66,0:09:07.94,Main,All,0,0,0,,又出來更多奇怪的生物了！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.88,0:09:19.28,Main,Koala,0,0,0,,好，那就上了！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.88,0:09:23.63,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,騙人布！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.63,0:09:24.48,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,火！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.48,0:09:25.58,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,火？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.58,0:09:27.54,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,用火！這些傢伙是殭屍！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.61,0:09:30.40,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,0)}必殺…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.34,0:09:34.67,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,騙人布！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.30,0:09:37.15,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,喬巴！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.15,0:09:38.66,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,小心，後面！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.91,0:09:41.66,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,騙人布…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.66,0:09:42.33,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,喬巴…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.58,0:09:46.19,Main,Hippo,0,0,0,,你自己也一樣的處境！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.76,0:09:58.20,Main,Sanji-pen,0,0,0,,住手！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.53,0:10:04.54,Main,Zombie,0,0,0,,混蛋！你在幹什麼對自己的夥伴！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.29,0:10:08.44,Main,Zombie,0,0,0,,你的敵人是那個女人！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.44,0:10:10.42,Main,Zombie,0,0,0,,你應該打的是她！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.42,0:10:14.12,Main,Sanji-pen,0,0,0,,我完全不知道這位女士是誰，從哪裡來的…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.12,0:10:17.26,Main,Sanji-pen,0,0,0,,但即使違背主人的命令…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.26,0:10:19.24,Main,Sanji-pen,0,0,0,,即使我死…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.24,0:10:21.18,Main,Sanji-pen,0,0,0,,我也不會傷害女人！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.69,0:10:26.43,Main,Sanji-pen,0,0,0,,有意見的話儘管來！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.54,0:10:29.81,Main,Sanji-pen,0,0,0,,該死的殭屍！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.23,0:10:33.12,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,喂！怎麼了？！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.82,0:10:35.25,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,喂，小豬！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.25,0:10:37.18,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,你又做了什麼對吧？！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.18,0:10:38.28,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,老實說！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.28,0:10:42.09,Main,Pig,0,0,0,,我從一開始就說了我什麼都不知道。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.09,0:10:43.83,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,而且你現在在笑。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.83,0:10:45.24,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,真是明顯的傢伙。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.24,0:10:46.61,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,奇怪…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.61,0:10:47.70,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,連一聲慘叫都沒有。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.70,0:10:49.77,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,不知道是不是被勒死了…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.77,0:10:52.71,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,你的想法為什麼總是這麼黑暗？！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.19,0:10:54.86,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,好奇怪…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.86,0:10:56.76,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,連索隆也消失了。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.88,0:11:00.40,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,他們跑哪去了？！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.40,0:11:01.95,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,索隆和香吉士就算了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.57,0:11:05.93,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,你在這種時候幹什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.24,0:11:08.78,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,喂！我在那裡面找到了鎧甲！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.78,0:11:11.26,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,穿上它不是男人的浪漫嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.26,0:11:12.19,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,才不是！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.19,0:11:13.48,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,浪…浪漫？！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.48,0:11:14.68,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,當然！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.68,0:11:19.18,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,你在獲得鐵之軀的時候，連心也變成鐵的了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.18,0:11:20.86,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,請原諒我！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.86,0:11:24.45,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,我絕對沒有想把心也變成鐵的！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.64,0:11:31.67,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,當你失去重要的東西時，一股不祥的風會吹過你的心。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.67,0:11:33.04,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,請聽我說…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.04,0:11:35.06,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,「鐵之半機械人旅人之心」
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.06,0:11:37.33,Main,Pig,0,0,0,,這些傢伙知道現在的狀況嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.33,0:11:37.96,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,喂。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.27,0:11:40.38,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,我們來到了一個大廳。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.38,0:11:41.09,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,真的嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.24,0:11:48.47,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,羅賓，騙人布他們在那裡嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.75,0:11:51.17,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,我不這麼認為。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.04,0:11:55.99,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,這個大廳的內部看起來像是室外…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.99,0:11:57.60,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,這是什麼地方？！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.60,0:11:59.57,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,就像一個競技場。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.51,0:12:03.53,Main,Pig,0,0,0,,沒那麼簡單。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.00,0:12:06.00,Main,Pig,0,0,0,,你們最好認命。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.00,0:12:09.62,Main,Pig,0,0,0,,你們不可能從這裡逃出去！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.78,0:12:18.63,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,佛朗基！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.56,0:12:20.23,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,是誰？！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.62,0:12:26.14,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,會動的盔甲！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.28,0:12:28.81,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,毫無疑問是殭屍。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.75,0:12:32.52,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,身上插著那些矛還能動。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.49,0:12:35.95,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,殭屍只是裝備好而已…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.95,0:12:38.36,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,我才不怕…！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.52,0:12:42.51,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}強力右拳！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.40,0:12:57.25,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,牆壁…！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.92,0:13:01.05,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,既然他用的是劍術…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.88,0:13:04.31,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}武器左手！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.41,0:13:21.32,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,佛朗基…！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.13,0:13:28.11,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,要殺我可沒那麼容易！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.59,0:13:31.60,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,尤其是你這種屍體！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.08,0:13:38.73,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,他又站起來了。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.73,0:13:40.48,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,門閂打不開。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.48,0:13:43.80,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,他跟我們之前看到的殭屍完全不同。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.77,0:13:48.18,Main,Pig,0,0,0,,你們很快就會明白的！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.18,0:13:50.47,Main,Pig,0,0,0,,那才是他們真正恐怖的地方！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.47,0:13:52.72,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,那傢伙，從那麼遠的地方說話！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.99,0:13:55.90,Main,Pig,0,0,0,,他們感覺不到痛！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.90,0:14:00.87,Main,Pig,0,0,0,,那些全副武裝的將軍殭屍，每一個生前都是聞名沙場的人物。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.87,0:14:02.15,Main,Pig,0,0,0,,他們是不屈的戰士！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.65,0:14:07.13,Main,Pig,0,0,0,,一國騎士團的團長變成了殘暴罪犯。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.13,0:14:09.79,Main,Pig,0,0,0,,傳說中的武士、海賊、神槍手！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.79,0:14:12.59,Main,Pig,0,0,0,,想像一下那些人在變得刀槍不入之後會怎樣！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.59,0:14:14.94,Main,Pig,0,0,0,,你們這種人怎麼可能打得過他們！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.87,0:14:19.59,Main,Pig,0,0,0,,就算是現在，你們的同伴也在危難之中！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.59,0:14:20.35,Main,Pig,0,0,0,,活該！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.35,0:14:22.25,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,你這混蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.82,0:14:23.71,Main,Pig,0,0,0,,牆壁殭屍！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.71,0:14:24.69,Main,Wall-zombie,0,0,0,,知道了！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.36,0:14:28.72,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,他封死了通道！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.94,0:14:32.43,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,被封的不只是那條路。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.88,0:14:38.35,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,以我的經驗來看…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.97,0:14:41.47,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,這場仗不只是困難而已。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.47,0:14:44.09,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,到處都是盔甲！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.13,0:14:48.57,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,一個一個打沒有意義，因為我們的攻擊對他們無效。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.57,0:14:53.91,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,而且正面硬拚的話我們會被壓制。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.91,0:14:54.71,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,我明白了。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.71,0:14:57.79,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,你說得對，這又不是我們的最後一戰。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.79,0:15:02.75,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,如果從這個大廳直直跑過去，應該能到達庭院。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.75,0:15:05.93,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,好！那我們三個在那裡會合。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.93,0:15:09.62,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,小心別再讓人消失了。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.62,0:15:10.57,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,當然。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.24,0:15:11.95,Main,Zombie,0,0,0,,上！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.68,0:15:15.99,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,走！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.62,0:15:19.87,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,讓開！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.52,0:15:26.22,Main,Jigorou,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}三十六煩惱鳳！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.34,0:15:31.34,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,這招…！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.34,0:15:31.95,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,索隆！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.26,0:15:34.91,Main,Jigorou,0,0,0,,背上有傷是戰士的恥辱！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.81,0:15:38.95,Main,Jigorou,0,0,0,,但我渾身都是傷！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.95,0:15:40.28,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,你是誰？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.28,0:15:41.27,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,我還以為是索隆。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.27,0:15:42.92,Main,Jigorou,0,0,0,,我的名字是吉五郎！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.92,0:15:44.46,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,你跟他一模一樣！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.18,0:15:54.01,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,對付殭屍就用這個！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.01,0:15:57.04,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}鮮火！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.69,0:16:01.34,Main,Zombie,0,0,0,,準備水桶！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.75,0:16:04.71,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.88,0:16:08.19,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}十一輪花！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.88,0:16:08.19,Note,Robin,0,0,100,,{\fad(150,150)}十一輪花
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.09,0:16:10.71,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}翻摔！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.76,0:16:18.18,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,魯夫在哪裡？！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.18,0:16:20.23,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,他好像還沒出來。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.23,0:16:24.62,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,就算回去找，那個白痴穿著盔甲也很難認出來！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.08,0:16:31.01,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,他該不會也消失了？！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.40,0:16:33.42,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,但我們也不能耐心等他。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.42,0:16:35.97,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,殭屍馬上就會追過來了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.27,0:16:39.93,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,喂！草帽！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.18,0:16:44.46,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,好痛，混蛋！放我出去！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.46,0:16:45.82,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,什麼…？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.78,0:16:46.52,Secondary,Luffy,0,0,0,,混蛋們，放我出去，可惡！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.52,0:16:48.80,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,一點都不好玩，可惡！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.80,0:16:50.00,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,打開蓋子！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.00,0:16:51.53,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,棺…棺材？！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.53,0:16:53.67,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,馬上放我出去！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.67,0:16:54.44,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,放我出去，我揍扁你們！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.44,0:16:55.53,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,剛才那個聲音…！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.53,0:16:56.10,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,放我出去！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.10,0:16:57.43,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,喂，叫你放我出去！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.43,0:16:58.83,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,魯夫！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.83,0:16:59.62,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,不會吧…！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.62,0:17:01.44,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,草帽在那東西裡面？！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.44,0:17:03.52,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,追他們，妮可·羅賓！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.52,0:17:05.28,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,他到底在幹什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.28,0:17:07.58,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,他讓自己被抓了！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.58,0:17:09.22,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,草帽！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.42,0:17:11.56,Main,Spider,0,0,0,,你們別想追！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.68,0:17:23.37,Main,Spider,0,0,0,,喂喂！猴子！猴子！猴子！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.45,0:17:30.86,Main,Spider,0,0,0,,我就是赫赫有名的蜘蛛猴！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.26,0:17:32.48,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,一隻巨大的蜘蛛！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.48,0:17:35.53,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,這傢伙的體型遠超一般昆蟲！是隻怪物蜘蛛！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.53,0:17:37.83,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,叫你放我出去，白痴！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.83,0:17:38.42,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,打開蓋——
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.75,0:17:41.71,Main,Spider,0,0,0,,啊！又一個。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.93,0:17:44.31,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,可惡，棺材…！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.31,0:17:48.06,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,混蛋，你要把他怎樣？！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.06,0:17:49.83,Main,Spider,0,0,0,,別擔心。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.83,0:17:54.35,Main,Spider,0,0,0,,不管他遭遇什麼，你們也會親身體驗到。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.35,0:17:57.09,Main,Spider,0,0,0,,你們應該擔心自己…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.68,0:18:03.14,Main,Spider,0,0,0,,你們面前是我，身後是鎧甲士兵！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.90,0:18:05.81,Main,Spider,0,0,0,,到此為止你們這一夥就要…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.81,0:18:08.80,Main,Spider,0,0,0,,全軍覆沒了！
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main,,0,0,0,,

